WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.298
Week 27: Present Subjunctive: Will and Emotion. recommend and request action express reaction state necessity without overclaiming certainty

2
00:00:10.298 --> 00:00:25.271
Form and meaning. Applying the form. The subjunctive appears in a noun clause after que when the main clause expresses will, influence, recommendation, necessity, or emotion, and the subject changes between clauses.

3
00:00:25.271 --> 00:00:50.185
Model set. Recomiendo que revise los datos. Pido que participen todos. Me alegra que estés aquí. Es necesario que lleguemos temprano. Ojalá que encuentren la solución. I recommend that you review the data. I ask that everyone participate. I'm glad that you're here. It's necessary that we arrive early. I hope that they find the solution.

4
00:00:50.185 --> 00:01:00.464
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:01:00.464 --> 00:01:14.967
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: recommend and request action; express reaction; state necessity without overclaiming certainty. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:14.967 --> 00:01:40.649
Model language. Recomiendo que revise los datos. — I recommend that you review the data. Pido que participen todos. — I ask that everyone participate. Me alegra que estés aquí. — I'm glad that you're here. Es necesario que lleguemos temprano. — It's necessary that we arrive early. Ojalá que encuentren la solución. — I hope that they find the solution.

7
00:01:40.649 --> 00:01:50.654
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
